# DUKES UP: the gym. Walk left as night 1 begins and you find it: endless
# waves, the current one on the scoreboard under HOME and your best under
# GUEST; each wave's first four come in together. Every third wave, frightened passers-by run through first: a punch
# makes them drop food, a weapon or a dog. A fall ends it (no continue);
# the best wave is kept, for one player and for two apart.
game dukesup
wait 5
cheat pick 1 0
cheat run 1
expect gym == 0
hold LEFT 90
expect gym == 1
expect gym_wave == 1
# a wave's first ghouls come in together (wave 1: three)
wait 130
expect enemies == 3
# a wave is beaten when all its ghouls are down
cheat god
cheat clear
wait 45
cheat clear
wait 45
cheat clear
wait 10
expect gym_wave == 2
expect save_gym1 == 1
# the third wave brings passers-by first
cheat gymwave 3
wait 150
expect kind_16 == 3
cheat freeze
cheat pos 1 220 140
cheat face 1 1
waituntil foe2_x <= 240 200
cheat foepos 2 236 136
press A 1
wait 6
expect items >= 1
# a fall ends the gym: the final whistle
cheat mortal
cheat thaw
cheat die
wait 80
expect state == 11
wait 70
press A
expect state == 0
# the walk left only works at the very start
cheat run 1
hold RIGHT 300
hold LEFT 300
expect gym == 0
